    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、俺は全然……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "なら私も『全然』\r\nむしろ一緒にお店を回れて嬉しいわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "アナタが何を選ぶか、気になるもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……！\r\nどうするかなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "クリスマスだし、いっそ思い切りはしゃぐか\r\n奮発したツリーにして──！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "デスクに飾る予定ってことは忘れないでね？",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "も、もちろん……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、その顔は忘れていたようにも見えるけど\r\nそっとしておきましょう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それから、はしゃぐというのは賛成！\r\nどうせなら童心に返って選ぶべきよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "キラキラのにする？\r\nそれとも綿がついてるツリーの方がいいかしら！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あれが雪なのか雲なのか、\r\nずっと悩ましいと思っているのよね……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……っふふ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、俺より先に夏葉が童心に返ってるなと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……！\r\n……思った以上にはしゃいでいるみたいね、私",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170026/4901700260100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700260110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "この時期に、アナタとこうして出かけられているのが\r\n楽しくて",
